        "content": [
          "Most verbs trigger ACCUSATIVE objects (AKK):",
          "besuchen, sehen, haben, kaufen, essen",
          "",
          "Ich besuche dich. (I visit you - AKK)",
          "Ich sehe den Film. (I see the film - AKK)",
          "",
          "And some verbs ALWAYS take DATIVE: (DAT)",
          "helfen, danken, gefallen, gehören, schmecken",
          "",
          "Ich helfe dir. (I help you - DAT)",
          "Das gehört mir. (That belongs to me - DAT)",
          "",
          "HOW TO REMEMBER DATIVE VERBS:",
          "Think: \"to/for whom?\" not \"what?\"",
          "I (give) help TO you, it belongs TO me"
